(1140,	117,	'_elementor_data',	'[{\"id\":\"42835350\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d0745b2\",\"elType\":\"e-div-block\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":false,\"styles\":[],\"interactions\":[],\"editor_settings\":[],\"version\":\"0.0\"},{\"id\":\"53dbeed8\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<blockquote><h4 style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">La vie des plantes est une entreprise qui vend des kits de plantes \\u00e0 faire pousser, des graines,<br \\/>de la terre, des pots, des pipettes d\\u2019arrosage, etc. C\\u2019est avant tout une histoire de famille. Cr\\u00e9\\u00e9e en 1927 en Anjou, l\\u2019entreprise produit des graines depuis trois g\\u00e9n\\u00e9rations. Leurs valeurs sont simples : d\\u00e9mocratiser le jardinage et surtout en faire une activit\\u00e9 ludique et p\\u00e9dagogique pour toute la famille.\\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 LIVRAISON GRATUITE \\u00e0 partir de 50 \\u20ac d\\u2019achat .\\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 Produits faits mains et naturels . Nos produits sont uniques et originaux.\\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 t\\u00e9l\\u00e9phone : 01 28 28 97 13.\\u00a0 Adresse : 84 Boulevard Raspail, 75006 Paris . Adresse e-mail : contact@laviedesplante.fr<\\/h4><\\/blockquote>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
